Q2. What are the different types of Inheritance?
Which are supported in Java?

Interview Ready Answer

1. Single Inheritance

One child inherits one parent.

Animal
   |
 Dog

Supported in Java.

------------------------------------------------------------

2. Multilevel Inheritance

One child becomes parent of another class.

Animal
   |
 Dog
   |
 Puppy

Supported in Java.

------------------------------------------------------------

3. Hierarchical Inheritance

Multiple child classes inherit the same parent.

        Animal
       /   |   \
    Dog   Cat  Lion

Supported in Java.

------------------------------------------------------------

4. Multiple Inheritance

One child inherits from multiple parent classes.

      A      B
       \    /
        \  /
         C

Not supported using Java classes.

Reason

Diamond Problem (Method Ambiguity).

------------------------------------------------------------

5. Hybrid Inheritance

Combination of two or more inheritance types.

Not supported using Java classes.

Can be achieved using Interfaces.

